        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Alter in Cube City</strong>, you'll step into a futuristic metropolis that runs on technology. The residents of Cube City get everything they need from a mysterious <strong>&quot;Button.&quot;</strong> But as the city's energy supply starts to fail and the city teeters on the brink of collapse, no one seems to understand the root of the problem... until you. You are Alter, a curious young boy who decides to embark on a journey of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a game; it's a reflective journey about the environment and the choices we make. When the Button can no longer provide for everyone, how will you decide the city's future?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Educational Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about important environmental issues in an engaging, educational adventure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Design</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique black and white world to uncover the true cost of relying on technology. Solve interactive puzzles to reveal the secrets behind the city's dwindling resources.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual and Audio Presentation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming hand-drawn art and a 2.5D (Isometric) perspective create a captivating visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character dialogue and unique language keep conversations lively and interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI-generated background music dynamically sets the mood and enhances the story.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Alter in Cube City</strong>, you'll step into a futuristic metropolis that runs on technology. The residents of Cube City get everything they need from a mysterious <strong>&quot;Button.&quot;</strong> But as the city's energy supply starts to fail and the city teeters on the brink of collapse, no one seems to understand the root of the problem... until you. You are Alter, a curious young boy who decides to embark on a journey of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a game; it's a reflective journey about the environment and the choices we make. When the Button can no longer provide for everyone, how will you decide the city's future?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Educational Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about important environmental issues in an engaging, educational adventure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Design</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique black and white world to uncover the true cost of relying on technology. Solve interactive puzzles to reveal the secrets behind the city's dwindling resources.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual and Audio Presentation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming hand-drawn art and a 2.5D (Isometric) perspective create a captivating visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character dialogue and unique language keep conversations lively and interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI-generated background music dynamically sets the mood and enhances the story.</p>",
        "short_description": "Cube City is a black and white city where people rely on &quot;button&quot; to get what they need, unaware that this practice is gradually draining the world of color and vitality. Alter, a youngster with a deep curiosity about the world, decides to embark on a journey of exploration.",
